###Read service metadata
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/$metadata

###Get all employees
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet

###Get Employee count
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/$count

###Get 1 employee
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C19927FB

###Get Female records
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=sex eq 'F'/$count


###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=sex eq 'F'&$count=true

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/$count?$filter=sex eq 'F'

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter= sex eq 'F'&$top=2&$skip=3&$select=nameFirst,email


###Insert a employee
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "nameFirst": "Vamsi",
      "nameMiddle": null,
      "nameLast": "Krishna",
      "nameInitials": "S",
      "sex": "M",
      "language": "E",
      "phoneNumber": "+1 224 374 524",
      "email": "vk.ui5@sap.info",
      "loginName": "VAMSIIK",
      "Currency_code": "INR",
      "salaryAmount": "5500000.00",
      "accountNumber": "1112256733",
      "bankId": "5100003",
      "bankName": "State Bank of India"
}

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=nameFirst eq 'Vamsi'

###Update a employee
PATCH  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/0b60440f-e172-4116-820b-24bada0ed4f9
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "Currency_code": "INR",
      "salaryAmount": "650000.00"
}

###Delete a employee
DELETE   http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/0b60440f-e172-4116-820b-24bada0ed4f9

###
PATCH  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/02BD2137-0890-1EEA-A6C2-BB55C19847FB
Content-Type: application/json

{
      "Currency_code": "INR",
      "salaryAmount": "645000.00"
}

###Display All purchase orders
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/POs

###Display a purchase order
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/POs(74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC40052)

###Display a purchase order
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/POs/74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC7E052/Items/$count

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/POs('74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC7E052')?$expand=Items

###Boosting a order
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/POs('74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC34052')/CatalogService.boost
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###View a POs
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/getPOs()

###get largest order
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/largestOrder()

###get status 
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/getPOsByStatus()


### Approve PO
POST  http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/POs('74867AD200E41EDBA5D8B0C98DC40052')/CatalogService.approve
Content-Type: application/json

{}

